{"sha": "3f5ba1e804b3f30129a461e415cf7400c83869c7eac3c7319a9ea3b92abcfccd", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:kinetic-theory} 章 --- 动理论与理想气体}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:1}", "$N = PV/k_BT = 1.013\\times10^5 \\times 10^{-3}/(1.38\\times10^{-23} \\times 273) =", "\\num{2.7e22}$；$n^{*-1/3} = (3.7\\times10^{-26})^{1/3} = \\qty{3.3}{nm}$，为", "分子大小的十倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:2}", "$u = \\sqrt{3RT/M}$：H$_2$ \\qty{1930}{m/s}，N$_2$ \\qty{517}{m/s}，O$_2$", "\\qty{484}{m/s}，CO$_2$ \\qty{412}{m/s}；N$_2$ 在 \\qty{77}{K} 时：\\qty{262}{m/s}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:3}", "$P = \\qty{3.5}{bar}$（绝对压强）：$n = PV/RT = 3.5\\times10^5 \\times 0.030/(8.314", "\\times 293) = \\qty{4.3}{mol}$，即 $\\qty{125}{g}$。在 \\qty{323}{K} 时，$P \\propto T$：", "\\qty{3.86}{bar}（表压 \\qty{2.85}{bar}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:4}", "$n^* = P/k_BT = \\qty{2.4e25}{m^{-3}}$；$\\lambda = 1/(\\sqrt2\\pi \\times 1.37\\times", "10^{-19} \\times 2.4\\times10^{25}) = \\qty{6.8e-8}{m}$；频率 $u/\\lambda \\approx", "500/7\\times10^{-8} = \\qty{7e9}{s^{-1}}$。$\\lambda \\propto 1/P$：", "$P \\approx 10^5 \\times 7\\times10^{-8} = \\qty{7e-3}{Pa}$ 时，平均自由程为 \\qty{1}{m}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:5}", "$\\rho = PM/RT$：\\qty{293}{K} 时为 \\qty{1.20}{kg/m^3}，\\qty{373}{K} 时为", "\\qty{0.946}{kg/m^3}。净升力 $(1.20 - 0.95) \\times 2800 \\times 9.81 = \\qty{7.0}{kN}$：", "约可托起 \\qty{720}{kg}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:6}", "$P_{\\mathrm{O}_2} = 0.21P$：\\qty{0.21}{atm}；在 \\qty{5000}{m} 高处为 \\qty{0.11}{atm}；", "珠穆朗玛峰上为 \\qty{0.07}{atm}，仅为海平面的三分之一。氧气进入", "血液的量与其分压成正比；分压降至三分之一时，肺部", "无法使血红蛋白饱和。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:7}", "理想气体：$P = RT/V = 2494/10^{-3} = \\qty{24.9}{bar}$。范德瓦耳斯气体：", "$RT/(V - b) - a/V^2 = 2494/9.57\\times10^{-4} - 0.364/10^{-6} = 26.1 - 3.6 =", "\\qty{22.4}{bar}$：分子间引力（$-3.6$ bar）超过了排除", "体积的作用（$+1.2$ bar）；实际的 CO$_2$ 比理想值低 $10\\%$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:8}", "$n = PV/RT = 10^5 \\times 50/(8.314 \\times 300) = \\qty{2000}{mol}$；$U = \\tfrac52", "nRT = \\qty{1.25e7}{J}$；$\\Delta U = \\tfrac52 nR \\times 5 = \\qty{208}{kJ}$；", "以 \\qty{2}{kW} 的功率，需 \\qty{104}{s}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:9}", "$\\Delta L = \\alpha L\\Delta T = 1.2\\times10^{-5} \\times 30 \\times 50 = \\qty{18}{mm}$。", "圆环：$\\Delta d/d = \\alpha\\Delta T = 0.05/49.95 = 10^{-3}$，于是 $\\Delta T = 10^{-3}/", "1.9\\times10^{-5} = \\qty{53}{K}$（孔会随其周围的金属一同膨胀）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:10}", "$\\tfrac32 k_BT = \\qty{6.2e-21}{J} = \\qty{0.039}{eV}$。氩气 $\\tfrac32 R =", "\\qty{12.5}{J/(mol.K)}$；氮气 $\\tfrac52 R = \\qty{20.8}{J/(mol.K)}$：双原子", "分子还通过转动储存能量（多出两个", "自由度），与其质量无关。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:11}", "六方向模型：与正文相同，$P = \\tfrac13 n^*mu^2$。各向同性：", "$\\langle v_x^2\\rangle = \\langle v_y^2\\rangle = \\langle v_z^2\\rangle$，且三者之和为", "$\\langle v^2\\rangle$，故每一项均为 $\\tfrac13\\langle v^2\\rangle$。利用分布的通量", "论证，得 $P = n^*m\\langle v_x^2\\rangle$（分子", "满足 $v_x > 0$ 时撞击器壁，每次动量改变 $2mv_x$，每个速率类的通量为 $n^*v_x/2$，", "再取平均），即 $\\tfrac13 n^*m\\langle v^2\\rangle$，结果相同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:kinetic-theory:12}", "H$_2$：\\qty{1.9}{km/s}，O$_2$：\\qty{0.48}{km/s}；地球 \\qty{11.2}{km/s}，月球", "\\qty{2.4}{km/s}。对地球上的 O$_2$，$v_e/u = 23$：", "超过该值的分布尾部完全可忽略；对 H$_2$，$v_e/u \\approx 6$：", "每年都有微小但持续的份额逸出，经过数十亿年，", "氢已全部散失。在月球上，$v_e/u$ 为 $5$（O$_2$），", "$1.2$（H$_2$）：一切都已逸散。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:kinetic-theory:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $V = \\qty{200}{m^3}$：$n = PV/RT = 1.013\\times10^5 \\times 200/(8.314", "\\times 293) = \\qty{8320}{mol}$；$N = nN_A = \\num{5.0e27}$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $m = nM = \\qty{241}{kg}$：相当于三个人的质量。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $n^* = N/V = \\qty{2.5e25}{m^{-3}}$；间距 $n^{*-1/3} = \\qty{3.4}{nm}$，", "为九个分子直径。", "", "\\textbf{4.} N$_2$：$\\sqrt{3 \\times 8.314 \\times 293/0.028} = \\qty{511}{m/s}$；", "O$_2$：\\qty{478}{m/s}。每个分子的 $\\tfrac32 k_BT$ 相同：$\\tfrac12 mu^2$ 固定，", "故 $u \\propto 1/\\sqrt m$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $\\tfrac32 k_BT = \\qty{6.1e-21}{J}$；总能量 $N \\times 6.1\\times10^{-21}", "= \\qty{3.0e7}{J}$；一辆 \\qty{1000}{kg} 的汽车以 \\qty{100}{km/h} 行驶时，动能为 \\qty{3.9e5}{J} ---", "房间内分子的热运动，相当于八十辆这样的汽车。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\lambda = 1/(\\sqrt2\\pi \\times 1.37\\times10^{-19} \\times 2.5\\times10^{25})", "= \\qty{66}{nm}$；所需时间 $\\lambda/u = 66\\times10^{-9}/500 = \\qty{1.3e-10}{s}$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 每秒撞击 $S$ 的次数：$\\tfrac16 n^*Su = \\tfrac16 \\times 2.5\\times", "10^{25} \\times 10^{-4} \\times 500 = \\qty{2.1e23}{s^{-1}}$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 每次碰撞给出 $2mu = 2 \\times 4.8\\times10^{-26} \\times 500 = \\qty{4.8e-23}{kg.m/s}$", "（$m = M/N_A = \\qty{4.8e-26}{kg}$）：作用力 $2.1\\times10^{23} \\times 4.8\\times10^{-23}", "= \\qty{10}{N}$，作用于 \\qty{1}{cm^2} 上：\\qty{1.0e5}{Pa}。该模型再现了", "大气压强。", ""]}